Figure 3.
IGF2BP2 dependency is Zika virus (ZIKV)-specific.
Huh7.5 cells were transduced with non-target shRNA (shNT) or shIGF2BP2 lentiviruses at an MOI of 10. Two days post-transduction cells were infected with (
A
